replace:     public final override val context: CoroutineContext = parentContext + this
    // ktc2: made when it is read, not kept. Kept, it would refer to this coroutine while the coroutine refers to it, a
    // cycle reference counts never free. It is what it was, `parentContext + this` (adding the Job takes out any other):
    // equal, with the same elements; only two reads are no longer the same object.
    private val contextWithoutJob: CoroutineContext = parentContext.minusKey(Job)
    public final override val context: CoroutineContext get() = contextWithoutJob + this
